// Lunge: swap places with the target after winning a fight.
//
// $181D4 is inside SetActiveUnitPosition, the routine the post-action proc
// calls to commit gActiveUnit's moved-to tile. The hack writes the (possibly
// swapped) coordinates itself and returns to $181DC.
//
// Note: the enemy AI commits its position from $3523C instead, before combat
// resolves, so AI-controlled Lunge holders do not swap. That needs the
// (currently uninstalled) LungeAI hook.
PUSH
ORG $181D4
jumpToHack(Lunge)
POP

ALIGN 4
Lunge:
#include "lunge.lyn.event"
POIN SkillTester
WORD LungeID
